  '$.examples[0].i18n', json('{"ru":{"name":"Онлайн-аптека","owner":"a5apteka.uz · Узбекистан","text":"По данным агентства, сайт стал быстрее открываться на телефоне, а переходов из поиска стало больше.","image":"/media/public/be9dc486-e60a-46e4-b368-2483367de8d1.webp","$h":{"name":"851pjo","owner":"16eguyj","text":"ptj2oh"}},"en":{"name":"Online pharmacy","owner":"a5apteka.uz · Uzbekistan","text":"According to the agency, the site now loads faster on mobile and gets more visits from search.","image":"/media/public/4b0aaf6b-5963-4d16-9c15-9cd1c24478cc.webp","$h":{"name":"851pjo","owner":"16eguyj","text":"ptj2oh"}}}'),
  '$.examples[1].i18n', json('{"ru":{"name":"Сайт банка","owner":"Ipak Yo‘li Bank · Узбекистан","text":"По данным агентства, сайт банка стал заметнее в поиске, а переходов из поиска стало больше.","image":"/media/public/5174aa90-9c98-40a3-b320-fc7bcf9f4bc1.webp","$h":{"name":"orp2nz","owner":"1gytdsi","text":"ospbn1"}},"en":{"name":"Bank website","owner":"Ipak Yo‘li Bank · Uzbekistan","text":"According to the agency, the bank’s website became more visible in search and gets more visits from it.","image":"/media/public/8180b506-ab3e-411f-be69-33d23e112a74.webp","$h":{"name":"orp2nz","owner":"1gytdsi","text":"ospbn1"}}}'),
  '$.examples[2].i18n', json('{"ru":{"name":"Сайт недвижимости","owner":"uysot.uz · Узбекистан","text":"По данным агентства, добавлены новые страницы и понятные адреса страниц, переходов из поиска стало больше.","image":"/media/public/c30420db-aee0-42d1-af91-3c88ae581673.webp","imageMobile":"/media/public/3e316a3f-ceee-4f1e-8566-3dbf990512d5.webp","$h":{"name":"1fkx9y4","owner":"zmcfl","text":"10yxh5j"}},"en":{"name":"Real estate website","owner":"uysot.uz · Uzbekistan","text":"According to the agency, new pages and clear page URLs were added, and visits from search increased.","image":"/media/public/5d362f47-c302-463c-9c1c-47633b1a9cde.webp","imageMobile":"/media/public/5098fd43-c438-4156-932c-5431a4d8c7a3.webp","$h":{"name":"1fkx9y4","owner":"zmcfl","text":"10yxh5j"}}}'),
  '$.examples[3].i18n', json('{"ru":{"name":"Производитель спецодежды","owner":"Производитель · Узбекистан","text":"По данным агентства, переходов из поиска стало больше, а сайт поднялся на верхние позиции по основным запросам.","image":"/media/public/f7ac59dd-22b1-4a4c-a592-337f39bbd4ef.webp","$h":{"name":"w17fpv","owner":"10nu6d6","text":"16oic91"}},"en":{"name":"Workwear manufacturer","owner":"Manufacturer · Uzbekistan","text":"According to the agency, search traffic grew and the site reached top positions for its main queries.","image":"/media/public/dc1982ff-100f-4d09-b0ea-66f0bdbb659c.webp","$h":{"name":"w17fpv","owner":"10nu6d6","text":"16oic91"}}}'))
