  '$.examples[0].i18n', json('{"ru":{"name":"Переезд в облако и поддержка 24/7","owner":"Uzum Nasiya · Узбекистан","text":"Переезд в облако за месяц; гарантия доступности 99,98%, круглосуточная поддержка, резервные копии и защита от DDoS.","image":"/media/public/cfd3ea66-549a-4acd-b609-6596839ea5ec.webp","$h":{"name":"3bgi9m","owner":"7xnm5q","text":"155usgw"}},"en":{"name":"Cloud migration and 24/7 support","owner":"Uzum Nasiya · Uzbekistan","text":"Migrated to the cloud within a month; 99.98% uptime guarantee, round-the-clock support, backups and DDoS protection.","image":"/media/public/2be01768-0dca-49ce-b2a1-0c45a8c02b8a.webp","$h":{"name":"3bgi9m","owner":"7xnm5q","text":"155usgw"}}}'),
  '$.examples[1].i18n', json('{"ru":{"name":"Хостинг TCloud","owner":"Turon Telecom · Узбекистан","text":"Хостинг, VPS и домены .UZ с круглосуточной техподдержкой.","image":"/media/public/839f86ad-c796-478b-9c3d-d2bedf547825.webp","$h":{"name":"1o4v69y","owner":"pgamsl","text":"15qvitt"}},"en":{"name":"TCloud hosting","owner":"Turon Telecom · Uzbekistan","text":"Hosting, VPS and .UZ domains with round-the-clock technical support.","image":"/media/public/686c5f10-0fe9-4d0d-a198-ed5eb46c6ab4.webp","$h":{"name":"1o4v69y","owner":"pgamsl","text":"15qvitt"}}}'),
  '$.examples[2].i18n', json('{"ru":{"name":"Дата-центры Uztelecom","owner":"Uztelecom · Узбекистан","text":"Размещение серверов в дата-центре уровня Tier III (colocation).","image":"/media/public/1f9126ec-7573-473f-82db-32f8476eeca0.webp","$h":{"name":"a6z2ee","owner":"stt4nu","text":"1mljfss"}},"en":{"name":"Uztelecom data centers","owner":"Uztelecom · Uzbekistan","text":"Server hosting (colocation) in a Tier III data center.","image":"/media/public/5ab41ebd-a4c5-45a6-a704-c78b05c8d97b.webp","$h":{"name":"a6z2ee","owner":"stt4nu","text":"1mljfss"}}}'),
  '$.examples[3].i18n', json('{"ru":{"name":"Мониторинг работы сайта","owner":"Listen Notes · США","text":"Перевод мониторинга на Better Stack: мгновенные уведомления о сбоях и сокращение расходов в несколько раз.","image":"/media/public/7600c53c-83e6-4f73-92fa-426c80496cb8.webp","imageMobile":"/media/public/42b5fd01-8f62-41af-ba56-b2093ad9ef1f.webp","$h":{"name":"99421w","owner":"11lu8q3","text":"1y80cs1"}},"en":{"name":"Website monitoring","owner":"Listen Notes · USA","text":"Moving monitoring to Better Stack: instant outage alerts and costs cut several times over.","image":"/media/public/c3d64fbf-6d32-461c-b083-bffb52cea9d9.webp","imageMobile":"/media/public/6ffdf2c4-9da0-4d08-87ad-3eb0f8a6fd58.webp","$h":{"name":"99421w","owner":"11lu8q3","text":"1y80cs1"}}}'))
